### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PediaLink – HTTP test script (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ .http)
###
### Pre-requisites:
###   1. cd backend && make fresh        (builds everything, starts all services)
###   2. Wait ~2 min for Keycloak + services to become healthy
###
### Test accounts pre-loaded by Keycloak realm import:
###   admin@pedialink.tn  /  Admin1234!   (role: ADMIN)
###   doctor@pedialink.tn /  Doctor1234!  (role: DOCTOR)
###   parent@pedialink.tn /  Parent1234!  (role: PARENT)
###
### New accounts created via signup are synced to both MongoDB and Keycloak.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8090
@keycloakUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. KEYCLOAK HEALTH
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Keycloak realm info (confirms Keycloak is up and realm is imported)
GET {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/pedialink
Accept: application/json

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. SIGNUP (new user – NOT a pre-loaded test user)
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2a. Signup as a new PARENT (email OTP will print to auth-service console)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Marie Dupont",
  "email": "marie@test.tn",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "role": "PARENT",
  "phone": "+21612345678",
  "cin": "12345678"
}

###

### 2b. Signup as a new DOCTOR
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dr Ahmed Ben Ali",
  "email": "dr.ahmed@test.tn",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "role": "DOCTOR",
  "phone": "+21698765432",
  "cin": "87654321",
  "specialization": "Pediatrics",
  "licenseNumber": "LIC-001",
  "clinicName": "PediaCare Clinic"
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. LOGIN (pre-loaded Keycloak test users – no signup needed)
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ⚠ These users are in Keycloak only; profile endpoints (GET /api/users/me)
###   require registration via signup to exist in MongoDB too.

### 3a. Login as ADMIN  →  copy the "token" value into @adminToken below
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@pedialink.tn",
  "password": "Admin1234!"
}

###

### 3b. Login as DOCTOR
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@pedialink.tn",
  "password": "Doctor1234!"
}

###

### 3c. Login as PARENT
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "parent@pedialink.tn",
  "password": "Parent1234!"
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. OTP FLOW (for newly registered users)
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4a. Request OTP for email verification (check auth-service console output)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie@test.tn",
  "purpose": "VERIFY_EMAIL"
}

###

### 4b. Verify OTP  (replace 123456 with the code from auth-service console)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie@test.tn",
  "code": "123456",
  "purpose": "VERIFY_EMAIL"
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. PROTECTED ENDPOINTS  (paste token from step 3 below)
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@adminToken  = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@doctorToken = PASTE_DOCTOR_TOKEN_HERE
@parentToken = PASTE_PARENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 5a. GET /api/admin/**  – requires ADMIN role
###     Should return 200 with admin token, 403 with doctor/parent token
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 5b. GET /api/doctor/**  – requires DOCTOR role
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/doctor/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

###

### 5c. GET /api/parent/**  – requires PARENT role
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/parent/children
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

###

### 5d. Unauthenticated request – should return 401
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/admin/users

###

### 5e. Wrong role – PARENT trying to access /api/doctor/** → 403
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/doctor/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 6. PASSWORD RESET FLOW
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 6a. Request reset OTP
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie@test.tn",
  "purpose": "RESET_PASSWORD"
}

###

### 6b. Reset password  (replace 654321 with the OTP from console)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie@test.tn",
  "code": "654321",
  "newPassword": "NewPass1234!"
}

###

### 6c. Login with new password
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie@test.tn",
  "password": "NewPass1234!"
}

###

### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 7. INFRASTRUCTURE
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Eureka dashboard
GET http://localhost:8761

###

### Keycloak admin console
### Open in browser: http://localhost:8080  (admin / admin)
### Navigate to: Realm pedialink → Users / Roles / Clients

###
